   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="3">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">MARKET INTELLIGENCE PORTAL AT MOET - LEBTRADE</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This platform will act as the national portal or gateway for entities involved in international trade and will centralize information / procedures and documents needed to export goods from and to Lebanon. This portal will initially be targeted at exporters of agriculture products, but will expand to include trade data on all other goods. UNDP and UNIDO will support MoET in providing trade data on selected agro food products with the highest potential and propensity to export. The support will include: (1) A detailed Export Guide that will provide exporters with all the steps, procedures, forms, and information needed to export. The guide will also include an export readiness checker that will enable companies to assess their readiness to export, (2) Market Reports on 4 selected agro-food products. These reports will include in-depth information on external markets / consumption trends, external market requirements and regulations, as well as administrative requirements to export selected agro-food products to promising markets.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2020"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="1"></target>
     <actual value="1"></actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="3">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">FOOD SAFETY STANDARDS AT MINISTRY OF AGRICULTURE</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP provideS technical assistance to the Ministry of Agriculture in streamlining and simplifying access to food safety regulations that will be used as input for agro-food processing companies.  This information will be made available on the ministry&#x2019;s existing portal and will include steps on how to ensure and abide with food safety requirement. Ensuing easy access to food safety regulations is not only critical for local food safety but also to maximize that manufacturing facilities source products ensuring food safety standards.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2020"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="1"></target>
     <actual value="1"></actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
